# One agent-instruction doc only: AGENTS.md. Claude Code reads AGENTS.md natively (v2.1.277+),
# and Next only seeds a CLAUDE.md when no AGENTS.md exists — so a stray CLAUDE.md would
# silently fork the docs again.
CLAUDE.md

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
graft/

# PWA icons — generated at build time from frontend/public/logo.svg via scripts/generate-icons.mjs.
# Single committed source of truth is the SVG; the PNGs are never committed.
frontend/public/icon-192.png
frontend/public/icon-512.png
frontend/public/icon-maskable-512.png
frontend/public/apple-touch-icon.png
